fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2709618Z   ok   nor is an integer that flipped with it
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2709878Z   ok   nor is a boolean schedule that flipped
