fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2710240Z   ok   nor is a schedule this basin never populated at all
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2710429Z   ok   a payload with a float anywhere is not exact-comparable
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2710670Z   ok   the config-flow fixture is float-free, so the exact level covers it
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2710890Z   ok   and a solver fixture is not, so the exact level leaves it alone
