fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2711732Z   ok   the exact level catches a string-valued move the structure cannot see
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2711920Z   ok   the gate fails on the float-free fixture's string move
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2712061Z   ok   and on the fixture that grew a key
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2712258Z   ok   and on a captured scenario with no committed fixture at all
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2712447Z   ok   but NOT on the solver fixture whose floats merely moved
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2712641Z   ok   which is still reported, because a nightly can act on it
fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T12:50:39.2712810Z   ok   and the gate's verdict counts only what it fails on
